Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.56,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(278.5,57.208)}A Doramissic Crisis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.03,0:00:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. But, I have not told Nobita yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma' Dad is pretty good at dancin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so I should choregraphy for the party
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You went to see the dinosaur exhibit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it was fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.67,0:00:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was truly fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.37,0:00:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe such a huge creature once roamed around this planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.21,0:00:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ultrasaurus which was even bigger than Brachiosaurus...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.51,0:01:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It is hard to even imagine how huge it must have been!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We have not seen the real one, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.85,0:01:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's physical strength is leagues beyond your imagination!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.06,0:01:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw a real dinosaur?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we went with Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.03,0:01:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tyrannosaurus was truly tyrannic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have grown tired of seeing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giant, let's play a dinosaur game at my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, ma' true buddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even better than a real one!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.51,0:01:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.01,0:01:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They're too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.09,0:01:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing one in flesh ain't such a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi-{\i1}san{\i0} is much knowledgeable about dinosaurs than them, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.66,0:01:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see Ultrasaurus raising their young ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.77,0:02:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi-{\i1}kun{\i0}, I'll ask Doraemon to take us to the period of Ultrasaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I too want to see the dinosaurs, all of a sudden...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.69,0:02:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I am so happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.26,0:02:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing the real Ultrasaurus is like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.66,0:02:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna go too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.63,0:02:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's ask Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.61,0:02:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, I'll take care of everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch over Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.58,0:02:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgot anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.58,0:02:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The hospital card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.42,0:02:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The doc won't see you if you don't bring your card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.16,0:02:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.43,0:02:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.60,0:02:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}, welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.23,0:03:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiya, Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0} and Dekisugi-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I left it in the pocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Regular Helath Check-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.45,0:03:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I will come back as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.15,0:03:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorami will watch over you till then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.49,0:03:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.66,0:03:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}, I have a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead! And tell me what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.31,0:03:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall take you all to the Jurassic period in my bro's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.18,0:03:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi-{\i1}san{\i0}, which period you'd like to go to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,14 million years ago at the climax of the Jurassic period.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.82,0:03:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the race of Ultrasaurus flourished then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.13,0:04:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,At Colorado river, in the present America, they discovered the fossils of Ultrasaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem quite knowledgeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You flatter me, I just read it in the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.47,0:04:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Got ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.41,0:04:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,14 million years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.11,0:04:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jurassic period, time travel, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful, there are cedar and straw trees all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.51,0:04:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as described in the Encyclopedia, but the real deal is so huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we set foot at land?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.58,0:04:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Colorado forest looks so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:04:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We descend!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.15,0:05:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a response in the radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I see nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.39,0:05:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the metal detector radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.06,0:05:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to get metal reactions at this period.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be you imagining things!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.03,0:05:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time we go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.71,0:05:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes'm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There is an important thing I need to tell you before we get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt the living beings and the flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.85,0:05:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dora-{\i1}chan{\i0} told us before already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we take a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.59,0:05:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.59,0:05:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It is warm, just as I expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.73,0:05:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So this climate caused the trees to grow so big?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How fresh the air is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt, Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi-{\i1}san{\i0}, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we get to see Ultrasaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Triceratops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.21,0:06:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So fun, let's get a closer view!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.22,0:06:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Triceratops is ok...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.95,0:06:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I prefer a bigger dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah, so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi-{\i1}kun{\i0}, I have found a bigger one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a pic of me with this giant baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:07:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the carnivorous Aursaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.44,0:07:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pretty far away, We should be safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Urusaurus is so willful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, he must have been hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0} appeared tasty to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd say Dorami would look more delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.97,0:08:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.01,0:08:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to say I am fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.57,0:08:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.04,0:08:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see Ultrasaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we set out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun has set.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's camp somewhere safe for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.39,0:08:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Portable Camping Capsule!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, go in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 4 rooms, you are free to choose the one that you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.05,0:08:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Doremi's gadget is so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, I have a shower room just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so happy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Gourmet Sheet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak your orders and it will appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I am hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I order pork in big bowl
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, too big a bowl
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I order Spaghetti meat sauce and Corn Soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.75,0:09:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I order pancake and milk tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi-{\i1}san{\i0}, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I order beefsteak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.53,0:10:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky is so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.83,0:10:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jurassic sky looks so mysterious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.63,0:10:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,i hope we can see the Ultrasaurus tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We should get up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of things happened today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And the dinosaurs are sleeping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that red light?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A red light glimmered in that direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and I heard the dinosaurs screaming...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.91,0:10:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:11:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You are still half-asleep. \NYou must have mistook a shooting star with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.42,0:11:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, we should get up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.02,0:11:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.22,0:11:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I did see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.75,0:11:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a deep and relaxing sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.99,0:11:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mornin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh air!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You didn't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was excited of hoping to see Ultrasaurus, that I couldn't get a sound sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:11:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.27,0:12:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where's Ultrasaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The fossil was found at the lake bed of Colorado lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So we should head there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we set out after dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You two finished so quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.27,0:12:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}, let's fly with the bamboo 'copter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.28,0:12:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I forget to take the backup battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's try our best not to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hornetasaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.97,0:13:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Momotaro's Millet Dumplings!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.22,0:13:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,These dinosaur run very fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's ride 'em and look for Ultrasaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.63,0:13:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have ride it before, so I can ride it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.87,0:13:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hop on 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.47,0:13:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.74,0:13:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can not ride well!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward, hold the neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Dinosaur, take us to the lake side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!, are you all right? Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.68,0:14:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I am alright, somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.23,0:14:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}, hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Dinosaur, please calm down. \NWe have got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.65,0:15:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.69,0:15:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be Ultrasaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.63,0:15:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The real Ultrasaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.15,0:15:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The biggest creature in the 3 billion years history of this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me it's not a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We are looking at the real Ultrasaurus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.21,0:15:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.85,0:16:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So huge parents with so tiny babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.85,0:16:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So Ultrasaurus breed the kids in group.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's approach closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but make sure not to scare them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.72,0:16:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}, lend me the bamboo 'copter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.69,0:16:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.86,0:16:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:17:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So big!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I can feel them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the Ultrasaurus 30 feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.99,0:17:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for interrupting your dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.06,0:17:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}, it's so huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's charm is so wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could've done such a terrible thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.07,0:18:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A Nurse robot and some runts of the 20 century!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.81,0:18:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you do such terrible thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sell the dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you are the dinosaur hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that red light shot the dinosaurs yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's parent is taking a quick nap inside my time machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.57,0:18:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up and go backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sell both of them at high price.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.94,0:18:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll kill you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.51,0:18:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take anything funny out of your 4-D pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I am serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up, say your prayers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It was unlucky for you to play in this dangerous place!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.17,0:19:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.33,0:19:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dinosaurs lived here by themselves in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.27,0:19:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who disturbs this peace are the ones who're really dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dekisugi-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop Watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of them are really scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.39,0:20:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Momotaro's Rice Dumplings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.35,0:20:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dora-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.55,0:20:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they're ok...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.49,0:20:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.45,0:20:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, how did you find us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My health checkup was finished, earlier than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.43,0:20:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And Dorami's time machine was absent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So I came following your trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.43,0:20:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved you guys at the time of "A Doramissic Crisis".
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.04,0:20:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I was careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.11,0:20:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.27,0:20:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:20:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch, ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.61,0:21:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you dinosaur! I'll catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't gettin' away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.55,0:21:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrest Set!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.49,0:21:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro, Ultrasaurus's mum is in real danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.06,0:21:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you cure her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.75,0:21:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Take 2 pills at once, remember to drink water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, this should cure her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.31,0:22:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Great...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.71,0:22:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.85,0:22:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, what will happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.33,0:22:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've contacted the Time Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.57,0:22:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, Dorami-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.04,0:22:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your taking me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.21,0:22:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Though unpleasant stuff happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.08,0:22:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.22,0:22:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared! \NPlease help!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.56,0:22:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Time Police!
